canvas 520 300
label "Discovery flow: a describedby link in any page head or a Link header on the root leads to the well-known discovery document (highlighted), which points at graph.jsonld, llms.txt, the ontology, the licence and the specification; its profile URI resolves to the profile page"
caption "The highlighted document is the single entry point: every machine artefact is one hop from it, and its profile URI explains how to read it."
box page 16 40 130 50 "any HTML page|rel=describedby"
box hdr 16 120 130 50 "Link header on /"
box wk 190 70 150 60 "/.well-known/|knowledge-linkset" acc
box o1 380 20 124 34 "graph.jsonld"
box o2 380 64 124 34 "llms.txt"
box o3 380 108 124 34 "ontology (/ns/)"
box o4 380 152 124 34 "licence (/legal/)"
box o5 380 196 124 34 "specification"
box prof 190 190 150 50 "profile URI (w3id)|→ profile page"
arrow page wk
arrow hdr wk
arrow wk o1
arrow wk o2
arrow wk o3
arrow wk o4
arrow wk o5
arrow wk prof
note "one document lists every machine artefact; the profile URI says how to read it"
